{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15104440","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15104440","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1510444001:0":{"text":"Look! She's a witch! It's because of her that Sarethiel's punishing us!","source_cn":"看呐，她……她会巫术！就是因为她，赛图恩才会降罪于呼临城！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x738B5ACF9A2DFFB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510444002:0":{"text":"Get out of our way! That furspawn must die today!","source_cn":"滚开！你们别挡路！那个兽人今天必须要上火刑架！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x465597D2444085FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1510444002":{"text":"Get out of our way! That furspawn must die today!","source_cn":"滚开！你们别挡路！那个兽人今天必须要上火刑架！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x465597D2444085FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510444003:0":{"text":"...?!","source_cn":"？！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0757C5A2F486B28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510444005:0":{"text":"Hear me, people of Halia! What Gala just used wasn't witchcraft! It was magic!","source_cn":"呼临的居民啊，请听我说，加拉刚才所用的不是巫术，而是魔法！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92CEFC3D1F5B1064","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510444006:0":{"text":"She's an apprentice of the Arcane Council. Regulus Abundius has given us permission to use magic within the city.","source_cn":"她是魔法师协会的学徒，我们已经得到了阿邦德领主在城内施...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BA1C1F2A928012C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510444007:0":{"text":"We're trying to use magic to lift the curse from Halia to save you all from the locusts and bring back the rain! So, why are you repaying our aid with torch and fury?","source_cn":"我们正计划用魔法压制呼临城所遭受的诅咒，让你们免除针蝗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF220CE30397A2726","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510444008:0":{"text":"Was that magic...?","source_cn":"魔法……？这就是魔法？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCA6270399AEBD492","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Was that magic...?","female":"Was that magic...?","variant_male_record_index":"180500","variant_female_record_index":"180501","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510444009:0":{"text":"I can do magic like Merlin and Morgan...?","source_cn":"我会……魔法？和梅林、摩根他们一样？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3EB263473D82A581","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I can do magic like Merlin and Morgan...?","female":"I can do magic like Merlin and Morgan...?","variant_male_record_index":"180502","variant_female_record_index":"180503","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1510444009":{"text":"I can do magic like Merlin and Morgan...?","source_cn":"我会……魔法？和梅林、摩根他们一样？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3EB263473D82A581","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I can do magic like Merlin and Morgan...?","female":"I can do magic like Merlin and Morgan...?","variant_male_record_index":"180502","variant_female_record_index":"180503","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1510444010:0":{"text":"I didn't know I could do this. All Modra said was that I was special. That is why I was chosen to be the sacrifice.","source_cn":"加拉不知道……蒙多说加拉是特别的，所以才会被选中作为狩...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC3547B1B18A9A424","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I didn't know I could do this. All Modra said was that I was special. That is why I was chosen to be the sacrifice.","female":"I didn't know I could do this. All Modra said was that I was special. That is why I was chosen to be the sacrifice.","variant_male_record_index":"180504","variant_female_record_index":"180505","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510444011:0":{"text":"You are special, Gala. Magic is a rare gift only given to a select few.","source_cn":"加拉，你确实很特别。魔法天赋极为罕见，只会在个别人身上觉醒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03663C8D8D6629DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1510444012:0":{"text":"Give us your word that you'll live, and not let such a wondrous gift go to waste.","source_cn":"答应我们，好好活着，别浪费你的魔法天赋，好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x212E91130FC3DECE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1510444013:0":{"text":"This is your purpose. Your life and soul were never meant to be given to some god or deity... They were always your own. You can choose for yourself.","source_cn":"那才是你真正应该做的事。你的灵魂属于自己，不是为了某位...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C0D99E36D1F2D9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1510444014:0":{"text":"Choose for myself...?","source_cn":"为了我自己……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C77D3B42968BA8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1510444015:0":{"text":"But Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>...?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDA906F9CE53F8366","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"But Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>...?","female":"But Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>...?","variant_male_record_index":"180510","variant_female_record_index":"180511","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1510444015":{"text":"But Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>...?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>大人？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDA906F9CE53F8366","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"But Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>...?","female":"But Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>...?","variant_male_record_index":"180510","variant_female_record_index":"180511","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1510444016:0":{"text":"I don't quite understand yet.","source_cn":"加拉还没有完全明白……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4590D10230FEB74E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I don't quite understand yet.","female":"I don't quite understand yet.","variant_male_record_index":"180512","variant_female_record_index":"180513","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1510444017:0":{"text":"But I'll try to...","source_cn":"但，我会努力明白的。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x84E767C8306688CB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"But I'll try to...","female":"But I'll try to...","variant_male_record_index":"180514","variant_female_record_index":"180515","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1510444018:0":{"text":"...live life for myself.","source_cn":"为自己而活。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCAE197B7CE342DFA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...live life for myself.","female":"...live life for myself.","variant_male_record_index":"180516","variant_female_record_index":"180517","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1510444019:0":{"text":"Not bad, kid. Keep at it, and maybe one day you'll be a full member of the Arcane Council.","source_cn":"不错，好好努力，也许你以后能成为魔法师协会中的一员呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x623E915FEAAD08FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1510444020:0":{"text":"I'd love to have another soul to pawn my work off to...","source_cn":"能帮我分摊分摊工作就更好了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1599541D2EBD7BCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1510444021:0":{"text":"Stop! Don't let that Wildborn get away!","source_cn":"等……等等，别让那个兽人跑了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x394706B17562EB88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1510444022:0":{"text":"The spell is gone! Stop them! They're in cahoots with the Wildborn!","source_cn":"——巫术消失了！拦下他们！他们是兽人的同伙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ABFF35DE5D83664","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1510444023:0":{"text":"Seriously, this needs to stop. Hey, initiate, your magic wears off too quickly.","source_cn":"啊……真是，有完没完。新人，你的魔法失效太快了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC27CA7FC898C5BFC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Seriously, this needs to stop. Hey, initiate, your magic wears off too quickly.","female":"Seriously, this needs to stop. Hey, initiate, your magic wears off too quickly.","variant_male_record_index":"180522","variant_female_record_index":"180523","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:45:1510445001:":{"text":"Stop them!","source_cn":"不许走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EE9CA2AA59C3BEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:45:1510445002:":{"text":"Arrest them!","source_cn":"把他们一起抓起来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB89A451490E81BF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:45:1510445003:":{"text":"Halt!","source_cn":"——都住手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CA7DDB32DB9D94D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1510446001:1":{"text":"These mages were sanctioned by Regulus Abundius himself. Who dares defy his orders?!","source_cn":"他们是阿邦德领主特许在城内行动的魔法师，谁要拦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x305D96450A6CB754","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1510446002:0":{"text":"Who will take responsibility for disrupting our lord's plans?!","source_cn":"耽误正事，谁负责？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E4E530817C8A74D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1510446003:0":{"text":"General Perseus, we know that you've given everything for Halia...","source_cn":"珀尔修斯统帅，我们都知道你为呼临鞠躬尽瘁……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65E49CBAB5F371CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1510446004:0":{"text":"But can we really trust them?","source_cn":"他们，真的值得信任吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60BBB38E367DA836","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1510446005:0":{"text":"Yes, we can trust them.","source_cn":"值得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF326D1ED4AC7FCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1510446006:0":{"text":"Let them go.","source_cn":"请松手，放人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDBBD79F187490EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:54:1510446007:0":{"text":"The townsfolk blocking your path reluctantly follow Perseus' orders.","source_cn":"阻拦你们去路的居民听从珀尔修斯的指令","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5C76ABC1248DF041","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The townsfolk blocking your path reluctantly follow Perseus' orders.","female":"The townsfolk blocking your path reluctantly follow Perseus' orders.","variant_male_record_index":"180532","variant_female_record_index":"180533","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:55:1510446008:0":{"text":"They make way for your party to pass.","source_cn":"为你们让出了一条路","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x066476F241524CCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1510446009:0":{"text":"Let's go. Our plan proceeds as before. I have artisans standing by at our designated locations.","source_cn":"走吧，按之前的计划行动。我让工匠在相应的地点做好准备了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39E0C12768F6A6F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1510446010:0":{"text":"Well, that was quick.","source_cn":"哦，动作真快。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA201A0FC4B3EB23D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1510446011:0":{"text":"Not as quick as you.","source_cn":"没你的嘴快。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF53AE8D28D98B3F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:63:1510446012:0":{"text":"... Are you alright?","source_cn":"你没事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95C1B73E1B19DEDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1510446013:0":{"text":"I'm fine.","source_cn":"没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65DB83B555847DAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:65:1510446014:0":{"text":"Good.","source_cn":"好。<key:dialog6>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7E59AA58BCB3AC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1510446015:0":{"text":"I'll dispatch my most trusted guards to watch over you all. We will not repeat today's unfortunate events.","source_cn":"我会派可靠的下属从旁保护你们，避免刚才的情况再发生。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C9C2EED272DD500","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1510446016:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, <style=\"highlight\">proceed to the watchtower on the right wall</style>. Morgan and I will synchronize the magic circle activation with your actions.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x40940BF1F6F4862C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, <style=\"highlight\">proceed to the watchtower on the right wall</style>. Morgan and I will synchronize the magic circle activation with your actions.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, <style=\"highlight\">proceed to the watchtower on the right wall</style>. Morgan and I will synchronize the magic circle activation with your actions.","variant_male_record_index":"180542","variant_female_record_index":"180543","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1510446017:0":{"text":"This is our last chance to save Halia.","source_cn":"能否扭转呼临城的命运，就在此一举。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD89804711E7821B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:71:1510446017":{"text":"This is our last chance to save Halia.","source_cn":"能否扭转呼临城的命运，就在此一举。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD89804711E7821B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1510446020:0":{"text":"Let's get into position.","source_cn":"那么，行动吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B33B408FB9F0D04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:71:0:1":{"text":"I understand.","source_cn":"我知道了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1A7A16927A7BEC88","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I understand.","female":"I understand.","variant_male_record_index":"76822","variant_female_record_index":"76823","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:76:1510446018:0":{"text":"Look at this amateur trying to outdo me. It's adorable.","source_cn":"你也是，新人。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6A1C52D63725AF84","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Look at this amateur trying to outdo me. It's adorable.","female":"Look at this amateur trying to outdo me. It's adorable.","variant_male_record_index":"180545","variant_female_record_index":"180546","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:77:1510446019:0":{"text":"If you want to annoy me, you'll have to try harder than that.","source_cn":"想气我，你也得再加把劲。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5C120EEECD3C4BE7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"If you want to annoy me, you'll have to try harder than that.","female":"If you want to annoy me, you'll have to try harder than that.","variant_male_record_index":"180547","variant_female_record_index":"180548","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:71:1:2":{"text":"Don't slack off, Morgan.","source_cn":"你要努力啊，摩根！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x97555BD9B1DC1015","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Don't slack off, Morgan.","female":"Don't slack off, Morgan.","variant_male_record_index":"76824","variant_female_record_index":"76825","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:78:150104442:0":{"text":"Upset that you have taken Gala, the Halians try to seize you. At the critical moment, Perseus and his men arrive to escort you to safety.","source_cn":"居民们不满你们带走加拉，要把你们拦下来一起抓走。危急时...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB2EFFA90570D6337","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Upset that you have taken Gala, the Halians try to seize you. At the critical moment, Perseus and his men arrive to escort you to safety.","female":"Upset that you have taken Gala, the Halians try to seize you. At the critical moment, Perseus and his men arrive to escort you to safety.","variant_male_record_index":"193652","variant_female_record_index"